Z||000000||Alex2004||12-07-2001||09:39 PM||||On my 84 Fiero i notice a clunking sound whenever i'm slowing down coming to a stop. It's not bad but kind of annoying sometimes it's alittle loud then sometimes you can barly hear it.  Could it be my brake pads are lose.  I also hear a rattling noise when going over bumps. coming from the left rear wheel area. And sometimes i hear it when i'm backing up.  Could it be my drive axle because that needs to be replaced soon b/c it makes a noise under hard acceleration and is slightly leaking grease.  Let me know!<BR>Thanks...<P>Alex...||||reg||5
